WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.420
Every morning and every evening, many Jews
say the same short line from the Torah,

2
00:00:05.470 --> 00:00:06.840
called the Shema.

3
00:00:06.890 --> 00:00:11.680
Hear, O Israel: the Lord
our God, the Lord is One.

4
00:00:11.730 --> 00:00:15.090
Many hope these will be the
last words they ever say.

5
00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:19.470
So what does that one word,
One, tell Jews about God?

6
00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:23.300
In this mission, you'll see how
Jews describe God as the Creator,

7
00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:26.010
the giver of the Law, and a Judge.

8
00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:29.400
Then you'll count the commandments
the rabbis found in the Torah.

9
00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:31.080
There are hundreds.

10
00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:35.470
Your mission: find out what the
word One tells Jews about God.
